# pacchain internal-keyword denylist
#
# Copy this file to .denylist (gitignored) and replace the entries below
# with your real internal domains, hostnames and proxy names.
# One fixed string per line, matched case-insensitively.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# The pre-commit and commit-msg hooks refuse any commit whose staged files
# or commit message contain one of these strings.

corp.example
internal.example.test
